# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "1. Recap of the spinless 1D Fermi-Hubbard system {#1-recap-of-the-spinless-1d-fermi-hubbard-system}"
msgstr "1. مراجعة سريعة لنظام Fermi-Hubbard أحادي البعد بلا سبين {#1-recap-of-the-spinless-1d-fermi-hubbard-system}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The 1D guide writes the model with **vertex** and **transfer** operators,\n"
"$V_j = 1 - 2a_j^\\dagger a_j$ and $T_{jk} = -\\tfrac12 (a_j^\\dagger - a_j)(a_k^\\dagger + a_k)$. With these operators,\n"
"hopping is $t\\,(T_{j,j+1} + T_{j+1,j})$, and the density-density interaction is a product of $V$ operators.\n"
msgstr ""
"يكتب دليل النظام أحادي البعد النموذج بمؤثرات **الرأس** (vertex) و**النقل** (transfer)،\n"
"$V_j = 1 - 2a_j^\\dagger a_j$ و$T_{jk} = -\\tfrac12 (a_j^\\dagger - a_j)(a_k^\\dagger + a_k)$. وبهذه المؤثرات،\n"
"يكون القفز (hopping) هو $t\\,(T_{j,j+1} + T_{j+1,j})$، ويكون تفاعل الكثافة-الكثافة حاصل ضرب مؤثرات $V$.\n"

